{
  "description": "hashEnrichmentInputs(inputs) = cyrb53(canonicalJson(inputs), seed 0) as 14 lowercase hex digits. canonicalJson: object keys sorted (UTF-16 code unit order) at every depth, no whitespace, Dates as ISO strings, ObjectIds and { _oid } markers as lowercase hex strings, undefined object values dropped, arrays in order. \"inputs\" are in Lowdefy serializer form: revive them with serializer.deserialize (a { \"~d\": ms } marker is a Date) before hashing. \"canonical\" is the text that is hashed. The source of truth is @lowdefy/connection-mongodb test/enrichmentInputHash.json; copies elsewhere must stay byte-for-byte identical.",
